<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-10263] MVCC: Concurrent cache stop can cause vacuum failure.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10263</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Vacuum.cleanup() can fails on cctx.gate().enter() if cache is stopped concurrently.&lt;br/&gt;
ctx.gate().enter() method fails with IllegalStateException and we&apos;ve got stacktrace in log for every cache partition.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Replacing enter() with enterIfNotStopped() resolves the issue.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
